1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:20,015
Video ya leo ni kuhusu nini? Ni kuhusu mchakato mbalimbali. Ni ngumu, sivyo? Katika sehemu fulani ya video, utauliza swali kwa Kijapani. Ukishasikia, tafadhali uandike maoni.

2
00:00:20,015 --> 00:00:23,015
Sehemu ya 1: Usajili wa Anwani / Mchakato wa Usajili wa Makazi

3
00:00:23,015 --> 00:00:25,055
Samahani.

4
00:00:25,078 --> 00:00:28,645
Nimefika hivi karibuni nchini Japani.

5
00:00:28,668 --> 00:00:32,101
Ningependa kusajili anwani yangu.

6
00:00:32,124 --> 00:00:34,324
Karibu.

7
00:00:34,347 --> 00:00:37,044
Karibu kwenye ofisi ya manispaa.

8
00:00:37,067 --> 00:00:40,001
Unataka kusajili anwani mpya, ndiyo?

9
00:00:40,024 --> 00:00:42,763
Ndiyo, hiyo ndiyo.

10
00:00:42,786 --> 00:00:45,753
Nina wasiwasi sana.

11
00:00:45,776 --> 00:00:48,176
Hakuna matata.

12
00:00:48,199 --> 00:00:53,888
Kwanza, tafadhali nionyeshe kadi yako ya kukaa na pasipoti.

13
00:00:53,911 --> 00:00:56,525
Ndiyo, nina.

14
00:00:56,548 --> 00:01:00,243
Nitaitoa kwenye begi yangu.

15
00:01:00,267 --> 00:01:02,200
Hii ndiyo.

16
00:01:02,223 --> 00:01:04,390
Tafadhali.

17
00:01:04,413 --> 00:01:06,079
Asante.

18
00:01:06,102 --> 00:01:08,302
Nitaihifadhi kwa muda.

19
00:01:08,325 --> 00:01:11,532
Uliingia nchini Japani lini?

20
00:01:11,556 --> 00:01:15,322
Niliingia Ijumaa iliyopita.

21
00:01:15,345 --> 00:01:17,351
Sawa, nimeelewa.

22
00:01:17,375 --> 00:01:22,648
Sasa, tafadhali jaza karatasi hii inayoitwa 'Teni Tohyo'.

23
00:01:22,671 --> 00:01:24,485
Sawa.

24
00:01:24,508 --> 00:01:27,766
Aa, nina swali.

25
00:01:27,790 --> 00:01:32,362
Furigana juu ya jina ni nini?

26
00:01:32,385 --> 00:01:36,385
Ni jinsi ya kusoma jina lako.

27
00:01:36,408 --> 00:01:38,411
Andika kwa Katakana.

28
00:01:38,435 --> 00:01:40,968
Katakana, ndiyo.

29
00:01:40,991 --> 00:01:43,127
Sawa, nimeelewa.

30
00:01:43,151 --> 00:01:47,984
Andika jina la nchi yako na jina lako la sasa.

31
00:01:48,007 --> 00:01:49,578
Sawa.

32
00:01:49,602 --> 00:01:52,369
Nitaandika anwani wapi?

33
00:01:52,392 --> 00:01:55,792
Andika ndani ya fremu pana hii.

34
00:01:55,814 --> 00:01:59,110
Ni anwani ya ghorofa mpya yangu.

35
00:01:59,133 --> 00:02:01,023
Sawa, nimeelewa.

36
00:02:01,047 --> 00:02:05,280
Kanji za anwani ni ngumu sana.

37
00:02:05,303 --> 00:02:09,336
Naweza kuandika ukitazama skrini ya simu yangu?

38
00:02:09,359 --> 00:02:12,833
Ndiyo, bila shaka unaweza.

39
00:02:12,857 --> 00:02:15,756
Andika polepole na kwa uangalifu.

40
00:02:15,779 --> 00:02:18,232
Asante.

41
00:02:18,256 --> 00:02:21,432
Anwani za Japani ni ndefu, sivyo?

42
00:02:21,456 --> 00:02:24,989
Je, nitaandika nambari ya chumba pia?

43
00:02:25,012 --> 00:02:26,587
Sawa.

44
00:02:26,611 --> 00:02:31,944
Jina la ghorofa na nambari ya chumba ni muhimu, kwa hivyo andika.

45
00:02:31,967 --> 00:02:34,100
Sawa, nimeelewa.

46
00:02:34,123 --> 00:02:37,400
Ni chumba cha 302, ndiyo.

47
00:02:37,424 --> 00:02:39,459
Nimeandika.

48
00:02:39,482 --> 00:02:41,215
Asante.

49
00:02:41,238 --> 00:02:45,272
Andika tarehe ya kuzaliwa na nambari ya simu hapa pia.

50
00:02:45,296 --> 00:02:49,829
Bado sina nambari ya simu ya Japani.

51
00:02:49,852 --> 00:02:52,419
Nifanyeje?

52
00:02:52,442 --> 00:02:54,486
Nimeelewa.

53
00:02:54,509 --> 00:02:59,276
Je, una nambari ya simu ya shule au kampuni?

54
00:02:59,299 --> 00:03:00,934
Sawa.

55
00:03:00,958 --> 00:03:04,134
Nina nambari ya simu ya shule ya Kijapani.

56
00:03:04,157 --> 00:03:06,209
Nitaandika hiyo.

57
00:03:06,232 --> 00:03:09,524
Ndiyo, hiyo itatosha.

58
00:03:09,548 --> 00:03:11,238
Nimekamilisha.

59
00:03:11,262 --> 00:03:13,541
Hii ndiyo yote?

60
00:03:13,564 --> 00:03:16,331
Tafadhali angalia.

61
00:03:16,354 --> 00:03:19,120
Ndiyo, nionyeshe.

62
00:03:19,143 --> 00:03:24,943
Jina, anwani, tarehe ya kuzaliwa na nambari ya shule, ndiyo hiyo?

63
00:03:24,966 --> 00:03:27,263
Kamili kabisa.

64
00:03:27,287 --> 00:03:29,663
Sawa, nimeshapata faraja.

65
00:03:29,686 --> 00:03:31,620
Nimejifunza na kupata amani.

66
00:03:31,644 --> 00:03:35,012
Sasa, tutaandaa kadi yako.

67
00:03:35,035 --> 00:03:39,602
Tafadhali kaa kwenye kiti hicho cha buluu na subiri.

68
00:03:39,625 --> 00:03:43,832
Ndiyo, itachukua muda gani?

69
00:03:43,855 --> 00:03:46,822
Itachukua dakika kama kumi na tano.

70
00:03:46,845 --> 00:03:50,742
Tutakuita kwa jina lako, basi subiri.

71
00:03:50,766 --> 00:03:52,569
Sawa, nimeelewa.

72
00:03:52,592 --> 00:03:55,392
Nitakaa na kusubiri.

73
00:03:55,415 --> 00:03:57,415
Umesubiriwa.

74
00:03:57,439 --> 00:04:00,206
Tunakurudishia kadi yako ya kukaa.

75
00:04:00,229 --> 00:04:01,847
Asante.

76
00:04:01,871 --> 00:04:04,638
Tazama upande wa nyuma wa kadi.

77
00:04:04,661 --> 00:04:08,795
Anwani yako mpya imeandikwa hapa.

78
00:04:08,818 --> 00:04:11,754
Harusi, kweli ndivyo!

79
00:04:11,777 --> 00:04:16,453
Jina langu na anwani mpya zipo vizuri.

80
00:04:16,477 --> 00:04:19,317
Ninashangilia sana.

81
00:04:19,340 --> 00:04:21,174
Vizuri sana.

82
00:04:21,197 --> 00:04:25,163
Hii ndiyo mwisho wa mchakato wa usajili wa wakazi.

83
00:04:25,186 --> 00:04:26,820
Asante.

84
00:04:26,843 --> 00:04:30,914
Nimefurahi sana kwa kunisaidia kwa utaratibu.

85
00:04:30,938 --> 00:04:33,415
La, karibu tu.

86
00:04:33,438 --> 00:04:36,576
Hii si mwisho bado.

87
00:04:36,599 --> 00:04:42,268
Kisha, tafadhali nenda dirishani upande wa kulia kwa mchakato wa bima ya afya.

88
00:04:42,292 --> 00:04:45,492
Aa, bima ya afya.

89
00:04:45,515 --> 00:04:47,482
Sawa, nimeelewa.

90
00:04:47,505 --> 00:04:50,105
Dirisha la jirani, ndiyo hiyo.

91
00:04:50,128 --> 00:04:52,195
Nitakwenda sasa.

92
00:04:52,217 --> 00:04:59,323
Kiungo cha tovuti ambapo unaweza kusoma tena maudhui ya video ya leo kipo kwenye maelezo na kwenye maoni ya juu. *Tovuti inaweza kuondolewa bila tahadhari.

93
00:04:59,323 --> 00:05:02,323
Sehemu ya 2: Mchakato wa Usajili wa Bima ya Afya

94
00:05:02,323 --> 00:05:04,756
Samahani.

95
00:05:04,779 --> 00:05:11,462
Nilisemwa nifanye mchakato wa bima ya afya kwenye dirisha la jirani.

96
00:05:11,486 --> 00:05:14,185
Karibu sana.

97
00:05:14,209 --> 00:05:18,675
Ni mchakato wa kujiunga na Bima ya Kitaifa ya Afya, ndiyo?

98
00:05:18,698 --> 00:05:22,632
Tafadhali nionyeshe kadi yako ya kukaa iliyo hapo awali.

99
00:05:22,655 --> 00:05:25,126
Ndiyo, hii ndiyo.

100
00:05:25,149 --> 00:05:28,389
Umeandikia anwani mapema.

101
00:05:28,412 --> 00:05:30,079
Asante.

102
00:05:30,103 --> 00:05:32,147
Nitathibitisha.

103
00:05:32,170 --> 00:05:37,304
Bima ya afya ni muhimu sana katika maisha ya Japani.

104
00:05:37,326 --> 00:05:40,393
Ndiyo, najua.

105
00:05:40,416 --> 00:05:45,216
Lakini, sistimu ya bima haieleweki vizuri.

106
00:05:45,239 --> 00:05:47,082
Usijali, nitaeleza.

107
00:05:47,106 --> 00:05:48,981
Nitaeleza.

108
00:05:49,004 --> 00:05:54,093
Ukitumbukia ugonjwa nchini Japani, utakwenda hospitalini, ndiyo?

109
00:05:54,117 --> 00:05:55,650
Sawa.

110
00:05:55,673 --> 00:05:59,540
Kupata ugonjwa ni jambo la kusikitisha sana.

111
00:05:59,564 --> 00:06:02,932
Je, gharama zake ni kubwa?

112
00:06:02,956 --> 00:06:09,189
Kwa kuwa una kadi hii ya bima ya afya, gharama utakazo lipa hospitalini zitapungua.

113
00:06:09,212 --> 00:06:12,709
Uta lipa theluthi moja tu ya jumla.

114
00:06:12,732 --> 00:06:15,400
Theluthi moja tu?

115
00:06:15,424 --> 00:06:19,912
Je, si lazima nilipie sehemu iliyobaki ya asilimia sabini?

116
00:06:19,935 --> 00:06:23,935
Ndiyo, sehemu iliyobaki italipwa na serikali.

117
00:06:23,958 --> 00:06:27,292
Kwa hiyo, ni salama sana.

118
00:06:27,315 --> 00:06:29,786
Hiyo ni nzuri sana!

119
00:06:29,809 --> 00:06:32,463
Nimepata raha kidogo.

120
00:06:32,487 --> 00:06:38,181
Lakini, lazima kulipa pesa ya bima kila mwezi.

121
00:06:38,204 --> 00:06:41,238
Eeh, kila mwezi?

122
00:06:41,261 --> 00:06:43,757
Inagharimu pesa ngapi hivi?

123
00:06:43,780 --> 00:06:49,264
Mimi ni mwanafunzi wa kigeni, kwa hiyo sina pesa nyingi.

124
00:06:49,288 --> 00:06:52,154
Hakuna matata.

125
00:06:52,177 --> 00:06:58,650
Wakati wa mapato ya kazi ndogo kidogo au unapokuwa mwanafunzi, ada ya bima inapungua.

126
00:06:58,674 --> 00:07:00,807
Inapungua?

127
00:07:00,830 --> 00:07:02,763
Sawa, nimeshapata faraja.

128
00:07:02,786 --> 00:07:06,521
Unaweza kujua sasa inagharimu pesa ngapi?

129
00:07:06,545 --> 00:07:12,378
Mwaka jana sikuwa nipo Japani, kwa hiyo nitalipa ada ya chini zaidi.

130
00:07:12,401 --> 00:07:15,568
Kila mwezi ni karibu shilingi elfu mbili.

131
00:07:15,591 --> 00:07:18,265
Kila mwezi shilingi elfu mbili?

132
00:07:18,288 --> 00:07:22,455
Hiyo basi, ninaweza kulipa.

133
00:07:22,478 --> 00:07:24,693
Sawa, nimeshapata faraja.

134
00:07:24,717 --> 00:07:29,599
Sasa nitakueleza jinsi ya kulipa pesa hizo.

135
00:07:29,623 --> 00:07:31,889
Sawa, naomba.

136
00:07:31,912 --> 00:07:35,180
Je, pesa zitatolewa moja kwa moja kutoka benki?

137
00:07:35,204 --> 00:07:41,887
Unaweza kusajili benki, lakini mwanzoni utapokea karatasi inayoitwa 'waraka wa malipo' kwa posta.

138
00:07:41,910 --> 00:07:44,527
Waraka wa malipo?

139
00:07:44,550 --> 00:07:46,962
Hiyo ni nini?

140
00:07:46,986 --> 00:07:50,046
Ni karatasi yenye barakoodi.

141
00:07:50,069 --> 00:07:54,603
Karatasi hiyo itatumwa kwa posta kila mwezi kwako.

142
00:07:54,626 --> 00:07:59,863
Nitakapata karatasi hiyo, nitakulipa wapi?

143
00:07:59,887 --> 00:08:01,723
Benki?

144
00:08:01,746 --> 00:08:08,146
Unaweza kulipa benki, lakini duka la usiku ni rahisi zaidi.

145
00:08:08,169 --> 00:08:11,369
Unaweza kulipa wakati wowote, saa 24.

146
00:08:11,392 --> 00:08:15,392
Ninaweza kulipa dukani?

147
00:08:15,415 --> 00:08:18,215
Hiyo ni rahisi sana!

148
00:08:18,238 --> 00:08:24,238
Ndiyo, onesha karatasi kwa mfanyakazi wa duka na ulipe pesa.

149
00:08:24,261 --> 00:08:28,294
Kuna tarehe ya mwisho, basi angalia vizuri.

150
00:08:28,317 --> 00:08:30,517
Sawa, nimeelewa.

151
00:08:30,540 --> 00:08:34,674
Nitakapopokea karatasi, nitakwenda dukani mara moja.

152
00:08:34,697 --> 00:08:37,030
Hiyo ni nzuri sana!

153
00:08:37,053 --> 00:08:41,853
Sasa nitakutengenezea hati, subiri kidogo.

154
00:08:41,876 --> 00:08:44,209
Sawa, naomba.

155
00:08:44,232 --> 00:08:46,365
Umesubiriwa.

156
00:08:46,388 --> 00:08:52,755
Hii ni kadi yako ya Bima ya Afya ya Kitaifa.

157
00:08:52,778 --> 00:08:56,551
Jina lake ni refu, lakini tunaiita kadi ya bima.

158
00:08:56,574 --> 00:08:59,210
Hii ndiyo kadi ya bima?

159
00:08:59,234 --> 00:09:02,234
Kadi ndogo sana!

160
00:09:02,257 --> 00:09:04,031
Sawa.

161
00:09:04,054 --> 00:09:09,054
Unapoenda hospitali, hakikisha unaibeba kadi hii.

162
00:09:09,077 --> 00:09:12,087
Ni vizuri kuweka kwenye pochi yako.

163
00:09:12,111 --> 00:09:13,758
Sawa, nimeelewa.

164
00:09:13,781 --> 00:09:16,955
Nitaweka kwenye pochi yangu daima.

165
00:09:16,979 --> 00:09:20,313
Unaweza kuiutumia leo.

166
00:09:20,336 --> 00:09:24,913
Jitaharishe afya yako na ufurahie maisha yako nchini Japani.

167
00:09:24,936 --> 00:09:26,419
Sawa.

168
00:09:26,443 --> 00:09:31,410
Asante sana kwa kunieleza vizuri.

169
00:09:31,432 --> 00:09:34,832
La, karibu.

170
00:09:34,855 --> 00:09:39,624
Kama una tatizo lolote, rudi tena wakati wowote.

171
00:09:39,648 --> 00:09:42,490
Ndiyo, nitarudi.

172
00:09:42,513 --> 00:09:44,551
Nawaonea heshima.

173
00:09:44,575 --> 00:09:53,654
Kama umeelewa, tafadhali uandike maoni.

174
00:09:53,654 --> 00:09:56,654
Sehemu ya 3: Kufungua Akaunti ya Benki

175
00:09:56,654 --> 00:09:59,134
Samahani.

176
00:09:59,157 --> 00:10:03,976
Ninataka kufungua akaunti mpya ya benki.

177
00:10:03,999 --> 00:10:05,999
Karibu.

178
00:10:06,022 --> 00:10:09,155
Kufungua akaunti mpya, basi?

179
00:10:09,178 --> 00:10:14,178
Leo unataka kufungua akaunti kwa madhumuni gani?

180
00:10:14,201 --> 00:10:19,535
Ninahitaji kwa sababu nitaanza kazi ya kibarua hapa Japani.

181
00:10:19,558 --> 00:10:21,173
Nimeelewa.

182
00:10:21,196 --> 00:10:27,045
Kwa ajili ya kuingiza mshahara wa kazi ya kibarua na gharama za maisha kila mwezi, ndiyo?

183
00:10:27,068 --> 00:10:30,354
Ndiyo, hiyo ndiyo.

184
00:10:30,378 --> 00:10:36,429
Mtu wa kampuni aliniambia nifungue akaunti katika benki hii.

185
00:10:36,452 --> 00:10:38,622
Nimeelewa.

186
00:10:38,645 --> 00:10:43,423
Kwanza, tutakufanya utambulisho wa mtu binafsi.

187
00:10:43,447 --> 00:10:47,724
Una kadi ya kukaa na pasipoti yako?

188
00:10:47,748 --> 00:10:50,518
Ndiyo, nimeileta.

189
00:10:50,542 --> 00:10:53,575
Nitaitoa kwenye begi yangu.

190
00:10:53,598 --> 00:10:55,845
Hii ndiyo.

191
00:10:55,868 --> 00:10:57,668
Tafadhali.

192
00:10:57,691 --> 00:10:59,294
Asante.

193
00:10:59,318 --> 00:11:01,752
Nitaihifadhi kwa muda.

194
00:11:01,775 --> 00:11:05,775
Muda wa kukaa unaoonekana una hakuna tatizo.

195
00:11:05,798 --> 00:11:11,642
Sasa, tafadhali jaza jina lako na anwani yako kwenye fomu hii ya maombi.

196
00:11:11,665 --> 00:11:13,279
Sawa.

197
00:11:13,303 --> 00:11:16,403
Andika kwa kanji na katakana.

198
00:11:16,426 --> 00:11:18,598
Tafadhali, ninaomba.

199
00:11:18,621 --> 00:11:23,838
Eeh, mteja, leo una stampu?

200
00:11:23,862 --> 00:11:25,531
Eh?

201
00:11:25,554 --> 00:11:27,600
Stampu?

202
00:11:27,624 --> 00:11:31,190
Samahani, sina.

203
00:11:31,213 --> 00:11:33,291
Nitafanya nini sasa?

204
00:11:33,315 --> 00:11:38,353
Kama sina stampu, je, siwezi kufungua akaunti?

205
00:11:38,376 --> 00:11:41,748
Aa, hakuna matatizo.

206
00:11:41,772 --> 00:11:44,505
Usijali sana.

207
00:11:44,528 --> 00:11:50,528
Hapa dukani, unaweza kusajili kwa sahihi badala ya stampu.

208
00:11:50,551 --> 00:11:52,751
Kweli?

209
00:11:52,774 --> 00:11:55,049
Vizuri sana.

210
00:11:55,073 --> 00:11:57,342
Nilikuwa na wasiwasi sana.

211
00:11:57,365 --> 00:12:01,932
La, hakuna matatizo.

212
00:12:01,955 --> 00:12:09,760
Sasa, tafadhali weka sahihi yako ndani ya mraba wa hapa chini.

213
00:12:09,784 --> 00:12:13,226
Je, ni vyema nikatumie sahihi ile ile ya pasipoti?

214
00:12:13,249 --> 00:12:14,816
Sawa.

215
00:12:14,839 --> 00:12:17,805
Tafadhali tumia ile ile ya pasipoti.

216
00:12:17,828 --> 00:12:19,795
Sawa, nimeelewa.

217
00:12:19,819 --> 00:12:22,954
Nimeandika ndani ya mraba.

218
00:12:22,977 --> 00:12:25,344
Hii ni sawa?

219
00:12:25,367 --> 00:12:28,985
Ndiyo, umeandika vizuri.

220
00:12:29,009 --> 00:12:30,891
Asante.

221
00:12:30,914 --> 00:12:35,728
Sasa, tafadhali chagua nambari ya siri kwa kadi yako ya fedha taslimu.

222
00:12:35,752 --> 00:12:38,886
Nambari ya siri?

223
00:12:38,909 --> 00:12:41,242
Hiyo ni nini?

224
00:12:41,265 --> 00:12:46,398
Ni nambari ya siri ya tarakimu nne unayotumia wakati wa kutumia kadi.

225
00:12:46,421 --> 00:12:48,438
Sawa, nimeelewa.

226
00:12:48,462 --> 00:12:51,429
Nambari nne, basi.

227
00:12:51,452 --> 00:12:53,028
Sawa.

228
00:12:53,051 --> 00:12:59,686
Tafadhali ingiza nambari mara mbili kwenye mashine hii nyeusi ili wasionekane na mtu yeyote.

229
00:12:59,710 --> 00:13:07,756
Usitumie nambari rahisi kama tarehe ya kuzaliwa au 1234, basi angalia.

230
00:13:07,780 --> 00:13:09,913
Sawa, nimeelewa.

231
00:13:09,936 --> 00:13:13,829
Nitaingiza nambari yangu ya siri.

232
00:13:13,853 --> 00:13:15,629
Nimekamilisha.

233
00:13:15,652 --> 00:13:17,285
Asante.

234
00:13:17,308 --> 00:13:21,750
Tutakamilisha mchakato, tafadhali subiri kwenye kiti hicho.

235
00:13:21,774 --> 00:13:24,387
Sawa, nimeelewa.

236
00:13:24,411 --> 00:13:27,078
Tafadhali, ninaomba.

237
00:13:27,100 --> 00:13:29,900
Umechelewa kidogo.

238
00:13:29,923 --> 00:13:34,457
Hii ni kitabu cha akaunti na kadi yako mpya ya fedha taslimu.

239
00:13:34,480 --> 00:13:36,556
Asante sana!

240
00:13:36,579 --> 00:13:40,713
Sasa nitapokea pesa za kazi yangu ya kibarua.

241
00:13:40,736 --> 00:13:42,944
Vizuri sana!

242
00:13:42,967 --> 00:13:46,540
Jitahidi na maisha yako hapa Japani.

243
00:13:46,563 --> 00:13:48,163
Sawa.

244
00:13:48,186 --> 00:13:52,919
Asante sana kwa kunieleza kwa upole.

245
00:13:52,942 --> 00:13:55,676
La, karibu.

246
00:13:55,699 --> 00:13:58,567
Rudi salama nyumbani.

247
00:13:58,590 --> 00:14:01,590
Sehemu ya 4: Mwongozo wa Mkataba wa Kadi SIM / Mwongozo wa Mwanzo kwa Mikataba ya Kadi SIM nchini Japani

248
00:14:01,590 --> 00:14:03,357
Samahani.

249
00:14:03,380 --> 00:14:07,380
Ninataka kutumia simu ya Japani.

250
00:14:07,403 --> 00:14:11,485
Je, naweza kufanya mkataba wa kadi SIM mpya?

251
00:14:11,509 --> 00:14:13,542
Karibu.

252
00:14:13,565 --> 00:14:17,198
Ndiyo, bila shaka unaweza.

253
00:14:17,221 --> 00:14:21,021
Unataka kufanya mkataba wa kadi SIM mpya, ndio?

254
00:14:21,044 --> 00:14:23,411
Ndiyo, hiyo ndiyo.

255
00:14:23,434 --> 00:14:29,867
Nimefika hivi karibuni nchini Japani, na nataka nambari ya simu ya Japani.

256
00:14:29,890 --> 00:14:31,724
Sawa, nimeelewa.

257
00:14:31,746 --> 00:14:38,380
Basi, kwanza tutaamua mpango wa kiasi cha data.

258
00:14:38,403 --> 00:14:47,650
Dukani kwetu, tuna mipango ya 3GB, 10GB, 30GB, na mpango usio na kikomo.

259
00:14:47,674 --> 00:14:51,874
Eeh, GB?

260
00:14:51,897 --> 00:14:57,230
Majina ya mipango yanaonekana ngumu, sijui vizuri.

261
00:14:57,253 --> 00:15:03,220
Kuna kanji na Kiingereza nyingi, naona kichwa kinaniuma.

262
00:15:03,243 --> 00:15:06,981
Haha, usijali.

263
00:15:07,004 --> 00:15:09,204
Ni ngumu kweli.

264
00:15:09,227 --> 00:15:11,960
Tutafikiria polepole.

265
00:15:11,983 --> 00:15:17,983
Je, unapenda kutazama video kwenye YouTube na kadhalika nje mara nyingi?

266
00:15:18,006 --> 00:15:24,773
Ndiyo, naona video za YouTube za Kijapani kila siku.

267
00:15:24,796 --> 00:15:28,963
Ninazitazama kwa ajili ya kujifunza, na nataka nizitazame wakati wowote.

268
00:15:28,986 --> 00:15:31,319
Hiyo ni nzuri sana!

269
00:15:31,342 --> 00:15:39,742
Kwa hiyo, mipango ya 3GB au 10GB itaisha haraka sana.

270
00:15:39,765 --> 00:15:46,535
Ikiwa unataka kutazama video bila wasiwasi wakati wowote, mpango wa 30GB ndio bora zaidi.

271
00:15:46,558 --> 00:15:49,172
Mpango wa 30GB, basi.

272
00:15:49,195 --> 00:15:52,195
Hiyo itanipa amani ya akili.

273
00:15:52,218 --> 00:15:54,917
Nitachagua mpango huo.

274
00:15:54,941 --> 00:16:00,193
Nimechagua vizuri mwenyewe, na ninafurahi sana.

275
00:16:00,216 --> 00:16:02,289
Sawa, nimeshapata faraja.

276
00:16:02,312 --> 00:16:08,346
Sasa, tafadhali nionyeshe kadi yako ya kukaa ili tuanze mchakato.

277
00:16:08,369 --> 00:16:10,535
Ndiyo, hii ndiyo.

278
00:16:10,558 --> 00:16:12,125
Tafadhali.

279
00:16:12,148 --> 00:16:14,046
Asante.

280
00:16:14,069 --> 00:16:20,113
Je, una kadi ya mkopo kwa kulipa ada ya kila mwezi?

281
00:16:20,136 --> 00:16:25,977
Ndiyo, nina kadi ya mkopo ya nchi yangu, je inaweza kutumika?

282
00:16:26,001 --> 00:16:33,080
Ndiyo, ikiwa ina alama ya chapa ya kimataifa, hata kadi za nje zinatumika.

283
00:16:33,103 --> 00:16:35,037
Sawa, nimeshapata faraja.

284
00:16:35,060 --> 00:16:36,527
Hii ndiyo.

285
00:16:36,551 --> 00:16:37,837
Tafadhali.

286
00:16:37,860 --> 00:16:40,460
Nitaihifadhi kwa muda.

287
00:16:40,483 --> 00:16:43,576
Ndiyo, nimeithibitisha.

288
00:16:43,600 --> 00:16:49,738
Sasa, tafadhali angalia mkataba kwenye skrini ya kompyuta kibao hii.

289
00:16:49,761 --> 00:16:54,528
Ndiyo, kuna Kijapani nyingi.

290
00:16:54,551 --> 00:16:57,984
Nitaeleza sehemu muhimu tu.

291
00:16:58,007 --> 00:17:03,540
Ada ya kila mwezi na muda wa mkataba vimeandikwa hapa.

292
00:17:03,563 --> 00:17:06,207
Sawa, nimeelewa.

293
00:17:06,231 --> 00:17:08,964
Bei pia ni nzuri.

294
00:17:08,987 --> 00:17:16,475
Basi, tafadhali weka sahihi ya kidigitali kwenye sanduku la mstari wa chini kwa kutumia kidole au kalamu.

295
00:17:16,499 --> 00:17:19,265
Je, nitaandika moja kwa moja kwenye skrini?

296
00:17:19,288 --> 00:17:21,767
Ndiyo, hiyo ndiyo.

297
00:17:21,791 --> 00:17:24,924
Andika jina lako.

298
00:17:24,947 --> 00:17:26,781
Sawa, nimeelewa.

299
00:17:26,804 --> 00:17:28,692
Nimeandika.

300
00:17:28,715 --> 00:17:30,392
Asante.

301
00:17:30,415 --> 00:17:33,058
Sasa, tutaandaa kadi SIM yako.

302
00:17:33,082 --> 00:17:37,615
Itachukua dakika kumi hivi, tafadhali karibu ukae kwenye kiti hiki.

303
00:17:37,638 --> 00:17:40,005
Sawa, nimeelewa.

304
00:17:40,028 --> 00:17:42,995
Umechelewa.

305
00:17:43,018 --> 00:17:47,885
Tumekuingiza kadi SIM mpya kwenye simu yako.

306
00:17:47,908 --> 00:17:53,283
Sasa tutafanya jaribio la kuunganisha mtandao.

307
00:17:53,306 --> 00:17:55,440
Sawa, naomba.

308
00:17:55,463 --> 00:17:58,396
Nina wasiwasi kidogo.

309
00:17:58,419 --> 00:18:00,952
Tazama skrini.

310
00:18:00,975 --> 00:18:03,913
Antenna imeanza kuonyesha.

311
00:18:03,937 --> 00:18:07,104
Jaribu kufungua mtandao.

312
00:18:07,127 --> 00:18:11,728
Waa, ukurasa wa YouTube umefunguka haraka sana.

313
00:18:11,751 --> 00:18:14,184
Ni haraka sana.

314
00:18:14,207 --> 00:18:17,207
Jaribio limefaulu.

315
00:18:17,230 --> 00:18:23,063
Sasa unaweza kutumia namba ya simu ya Japani na mtandao kuanzia leo.

316
00:18:23,086 --> 00:18:24,886
Ninashangaa sana!

317
00:18:24,909 --> 00:18:29,158
Sasa nitakuwa na uwezo wa kuwasiliana na marafiki na familia mara moja.

318
00:18:29,181 --> 00:18:33,115
Asante sana kwa kunieleza kwa utaratibu.

319
00:18:33,138 --> 00:18:36,304
La, karibu tu.

320
00:18:36,327 --> 00:18:40,220
Nikutumaini utafurahia maisha yako nchini Japani!

321
00:18:40,244 --> 00:18:43,244
Mstari wa 5: Mkataba wa Apartment Mpya

322
00:18:43,244 --> 00:18:45,444
Samahani.

323
00:18:45,467 --> 00:18:49,201
Nimepata apartment mpya.

324
00:18:49,223 --> 00:18:54,957
Leo ndio siku ya mkataba na kupokea funguo.

325
00:18:54,980 --> 00:18:57,036
Karibu.

326
00:18:57,060 --> 00:18:59,497
Tumekusubiri.

327
00:18:59,521 --> 00:19:02,854
Unafanya mkataba wa apartment mpya, ndio?

328
00:19:02,877 --> 00:19:06,527
Ndiyo, naomba utunzwe.

329
00:19:06,550 --> 00:19:09,750
Ninahisi furaha kubwa!

330
00:19:09,773 --> 00:19:15,340
Kwanza, tutathibitisha maelezo ya mkataba.

331
00:19:15,363 --> 00:19:22,218
Anwani ni: Wilaya ya Shinjuku, Nishi-Shinjuku 3-1-2.

332
00:19:22,241 --> 00:19:27,309
Jina la apartment ni Midori-Sō, chumba cha 201.

333
00:19:27,333 --> 00:19:30,420
Ndiyo, hakuna makosa.

334
00:19:30,443 --> 00:19:34,076
Hii ndiyo nyumba yangu mpya!

335
00:19:34,099 --> 00:19:41,156
Kodi ni shilingi sitini elfu kwa mwezi, inapaswa kulipwa kabla ya tarehe 25 kila mwezi.

336
00:19:41,180 --> 00:19:44,387
Sawa, nimeelewa.

337
00:19:44,410 --> 00:19:48,489
Nitakulipa moja kwa moja kutoka kwa akaunti yangu ya benki.

338
00:19:48,513 --> 00:19:52,046
Muda wa mkataba ni miaka miwili.

339
00:19:52,069 --> 00:19:58,685
Ikiwa utahamia kabla ya miaka miwili, tafadhali uniongeze mwezi mmoja kabla.

340
00:19:58,709 --> 00:20:01,342
Mwezi mmoja kabla, sawa.

341
00:20:01,365 --> 00:20:03,732
Sawa, nimeelewa.

342
00:20:03,755 --> 00:20:07,635
Sasa, tutathibitisha gharama za awali.

343
00:20:07,659 --> 00:20:14,508
Amehakikishwa kwamba ada ya dhamana, ada ya shukrani, na kodi ya mwezi wa kwanza zimekwisha kulipwa jana.

344
00:20:14,532 --> 00:20:19,098
Ndiyo, nililipa kupitia benki ya mtandaoni.

345
00:20:19,121 --> 00:20:22,210
Nimehakikisha, vizuri sana.

346
00:20:22,234 --> 00:20:29,567
Mchakato wa mkataba umekamilika, sasa nitakupatia funguo za apartment yako mpya.

347
00:20:29,590 --> 00:20:34,157
Haya ndiyo funguo za chumba changu?

348
00:20:34,180 --> 00:20:37,151
Ninashangaa sana!

349
00:20:37,174 --> 00:20:41,108
Ndiyo, zihifadhi kwa makini.

350
00:20:41,131 --> 00:20:43,897
Usizipoteze kamwe.

351
00:20:43,920 --> 00:20:47,687
Ndiyo, nitazihifadhi ndani ya begi yangu daima.

352
00:20:47,710 --> 00:20:53,768
Sasa, tutaeleza kwa ukali kanuni za kutupa taka katika apartment hii.

353
00:20:53,792 --> 00:20:59,089
Hii ni muhimu sana. Kanuni za taka?

354
00:20:59,112 --> 00:21:04,398
Nimesikia kwamba Japani ina kanuni kali sana za kutenganisha taka.

355
00:21:04,422 --> 00:21:10,889
Ninaogopa kuwa ninaweza kukosea kanuni hizi.

356
00:21:10,912 --> 00:21:13,479
Hakuna matata.

357
00:21:13,502 --> 00:21:16,106
Usikose moyo.

358
00:21:16,129 --> 00:21:19,696
Kweli, kuna kanuni nyingi.

359
00:21:19,719 --> 00:21:26,175
Lazima utenganishe taka zinazowaka, zinazowaka siyo, makopo, na taka za rasilimali.

360
00:21:26,199 --> 00:21:31,399
Eeh, kuna aina nyingi hivyo?

361
00:21:31,422 --> 00:21:33,708
Inaonekana ngumu.

362
00:21:33,731 --> 00:21:39,470
Pia, katika mji huu, kuna siku maalum za kutupa taka.

363
00:21:39,494 --> 00:21:45,129
Taka zinazowaka zinatupwa Jumanne na Ijumaa asubuhi kabla ya saa mbili.

364
00:21:45,152 --> 00:21:48,249
Jumanne na Ijumaa, sawa.

365
00:21:48,273 --> 00:21:51,284
Nina wasi wasi kama nitakumbuka.

366
00:21:51,307 --> 00:21:53,374
Hakuna matata.

367
00:21:53,397 --> 00:21:59,045
Pia, tumia mifuko maalum ya taka yenye uwazi hii.

368
00:21:59,068 --> 00:22:02,702
Unaweza kununua katika maduka ya rejareja.

369
00:22:02,725 --> 00:22:05,263
Mifuko maalum ya taka?

370
00:22:05,287 --> 00:22:08,566
Je, siwezi kutumia mifuko yangu mwenyewe?

371
00:22:08,589 --> 00:22:13,556
Kama utatoa taka kwa mfuko wako mwenyewe, hatutakusanya taka hizo.

372
00:22:13,579 --> 00:22:15,465
Nimeelewa.

373
00:22:15,488 --> 00:22:18,622
Inasikitisha sana, kweli.

374
00:22:18,645 --> 00:22:21,845
Lakini usijali.

375
00:22:21,868 --> 00:22:28,301
Kwa ajili yako, tunakutakia kalenda yenye michoro ya siku za wiki hii.

376
00:22:28,324 --> 00:22:31,857
Eeh, hii ni nini?

377
00:22:31,880 --> 00:22:35,734
Michoro hii ni nzuri sana!

378
00:22:35,758 --> 00:22:42,046
Ukiona hii, utafahamu mara moja ni taka gani za siku gani zinapaswa kutolewa.

379
00:22:42,070 --> 00:22:44,436
Ni nzuri sana!

380
00:22:44,459 --> 00:22:49,892
Kwa hii, nitaweza kutoka taka bila kukosea.

381
00:22:49,915 --> 00:22:52,315
Sawa, nimeshapata faraja.

382
00:22:52,338 --> 00:22:55,778
Ni vizuri kuiweka kwenye ukuta wa chumba chako.

383
00:22:55,802 --> 00:22:57,256
Sawa.

384
00:22:57,280 --> 00:23:00,213
Nitaiweka mara moja kwenye ukuta wa chumba changu.

385
00:23:00,236 --> 00:23:03,878
Ninafurahia sana maisha mapya yangu.

386
00:23:03,902 --> 00:23:07,469
Uwe na bidii!

387
00:23:07,492 --> 00:23:11,368
Kama una tatizo, wasiliana na ofisi ya nyumba wakati wowote.

388
00:23:11,391 --> 00:23:13,263
Sawa.

389
00:23:13,287 --> 00:23:15,087
Asante.

390
00:23:15,110 --> 00:23:17,283
Nitakwenda sasa.

391
00:23:17,307 --> 00:23:20,307
Sehemu ya 6: Mchakato wa Kuanzisha Umeme

392
00:23:20,307 --> 00:23:25,798
Halo, leo nimehamia katika ghorofa yangu mpya.

393
00:23:25,821 --> 00:23:29,555
Ninataka kufanya mchakato wa kuanzisha umeme.

394
00:23:29,578 --> 00:23:32,631
Asante kwa kupiga simu.

395
00:23:32,655 --> 00:23:36,348
Hii ni Kituo cha Msaada cha Umeme cha Tokyo.

396
00:23:36,371 --> 00:23:39,827
Unaanza kutumia umeme mpya, sawa?

397
00:23:39,851 --> 00:23:42,518
Ndiyo, hiyo ndiyo.

398
00:23:42,541 --> 00:23:49,382
Kwa sababu sijakuona uso wakati wa mchakato wa simu, nina wasiwasi kidogo.

399
00:23:49,405 --> 00:23:51,692
Hakuna matata.

400
00:23:51,716 --> 00:23:55,887
Je, maneno yangu ni rahisi kuelewa?

401
00:23:55,910 --> 00:23:59,284
Nitazungumza polepole.

402
00:23:59,307 --> 00:24:01,604
Ndiyo, ninaelewa vizuri.

403
00:24:01,627 --> 00:24:03,394
Asante.

404
00:24:03,417 --> 00:24:09,893
Basi, kwanza naomba anwani yako mpya na jina lako.

405
00:24:09,916 --> 00:24:20,316
Anwani yangu ni: Wilaya ya Shinjuku, Nishi-Shinjuku 3-1-2, Nyumba ya Midori, chumba cha 201.

406
00:24:20,339 --> 00:24:29,272
Wilaya ya Shinjuku, Nishi-Shinjuku 3-1-2, Nyumba ya Midori, chumba cha 201, ndivyo?

407
00:24:29,295 --> 00:24:31,295
Nimehakikisha.

408
00:24:31,318 --> 00:24:35,086
Jina langu ni Maria.

409
00:24:35,110 --> 00:24:37,361
Maria, ndivyo?

410
00:24:37,384 --> 00:24:39,123
Asante.

411
00:24:39,147 --> 00:24:44,001
Sasa, naomba nambari yako ya simu.

412
00:24:44,024 --> 00:24:52,458
Sijapata simu ya mkononi ya Kijapani, je ninaweza kutumia nambari ya shule yangu ya Kijapani?

413
00:24:52,481 --> 00:24:57,540
Ndiyo, nambari ya shule inatosha.

414
00:24:57,563 --> 00:24:59,763
Tafadhali nipe.

415
00:24:59,786 --> 00:25:06,192
Nambari ni 03-1234-5678.

416
00:25:06,216 --> 00:25:08,259
Asante.

417
00:25:08,283 --> 00:25:10,335
Nimesajili.

418
00:25:10,358 --> 00:25:16,200
Je, tarehe ya leo, Julai 9, ni siku nzuri ya kuanza kutumia umeme?

419
00:25:16,224 --> 00:25:20,390
Ndiyo, nataka kuanza kutumia leo.

420
00:25:20,413 --> 00:25:25,348
Sasa niko ndani ya chumba, lakini umeme hauwasi.

421
00:25:25,372 --> 00:25:28,542
Ni giza sana.

422
00:25:28,566 --> 00:25:30,232
Nimeelewa.

423
00:25:30,255 --> 00:25:34,661
Basi, sasa tutaanzisha umeme.

424
00:25:34,685 --> 00:25:38,019
Sawa, nifanye nini?

425
00:25:38,042 --> 00:25:42,685
Tafadhali panda breka katika chumba chako.

426
00:25:42,708 --> 00:25:46,475
Eeh, bre-ka?

427
00:25:46,498 --> 00:25:49,031
Hiyo ni nini?

428
00:25:49,054 --> 00:25:51,489
Sielewi vizuri.

429
00:25:51,512 --> 00:25:58,046
Breka ni sanduku nyeusi lenye swichi nyingi za umeme.

430
00:25:58,069 --> 00:26:00,935
Sanduku nyeusi?

431
00:26:00,958 --> 00:26:03,592
Liko wapi?

432
00:26:03,615 --> 00:26:05,748
Sionekani.

433
00:26:05,771 --> 00:26:13,611
Kwa kawaida, huwa juu ya ukuta karibu na mlango wa kuingilia, chumba cha kuvaa nguo, au karibu na jiko.

434
00:26:13,635 --> 00:26:16,310
Je, ni juu ya mlango wa kuingia?

435
00:26:16,333 --> 00:26:19,344
Nitaangalia kidogo.

436
00:26:19,367 --> 00:26:23,101
Aa, kuna sanduku fulani.

437
00:26:23,124 --> 00:26:26,257
Je, ni sanduku lenye swichi iliyo wazi?

438
00:26:26,280 --> 00:26:29,613
Fungua kifuniko tafadhali.

439
00:26:29,636 --> 00:26:31,836
Nimefungua.

440
00:26:31,859 --> 00:26:35,793
Kuna swichi ndogo ndani ya hiyo.

441
00:26:35,816 --> 00:26:40,073
Swichi kubwa zaidi iko kwenye hali ya 'kufungwa'?

442
00:26:40,096 --> 00:26:42,630
Weka kwenye hali ya 'kuwaka'.

443
00:26:42,654 --> 00:26:45,187
Iko kwenye hali ya 'kufungwa'.

444
00:26:45,210 --> 00:26:48,277
Je, naipandisha juu tu?

445
00:26:48,300 --> 00:26:52,306
Ndiyo, ipandishe juu.

446
00:26:52,329 --> 00:26:54,339
Sawa, nimeelewa.

447
00:26:54,362 --> 00:26:56,647
Nafanya hii kidogo naogopesha.

448
00:26:56,671 --> 00:26:58,690
Nitaipandisha sasa.

449
00:26:58,713 --> 00:27:03,286
Eeh! Waa! Umeme umewaka mara moja.

450
00:27:03,310 --> 00:27:06,276
Chumba kimekuwa na mwanga sana.

451
00:27:06,299 --> 00:27:08,533
Sawa, nimeshapata faraja.

452
00:27:08,556 --> 00:27:12,233
Sasa umeme umefunguliwa vizuri.

453
00:27:12,256 --> 00:27:13,825
Asante.

454
00:27:13,848 --> 00:27:17,582
Sikuwa nimewahi kusikia neno 'breaker' hapo awali.

455
00:27:17,605 --> 00:27:21,738
Nimefanikiwa kufanya peke yangu, na nina hisia nzuri sana.

456
00:27:21,761 --> 00:27:26,028
Haha, nimefaidika na kukusaidia.

457
00:27:26,052 --> 00:27:29,109
Toka leo, tumia umeme wakati wowote.

458
00:27:29,132 --> 00:27:30,703
Sawa.

459
00:27:30,726 --> 00:27:36,493
Ingawa tulikuwa tunazungumza kwa simu pasipo kuona uso, nilijisikia salama kwa sababu ulinieleza vizuri sana.

460
00:27:36,516 --> 00:27:39,370
La, karibu tu.

461
00:27:39,394 --> 00:27:42,760
Asante sana kwa kunisaidia.

462
00:27:42,783 --> 00:27:45,783
Sehemu ya 7: Utaratibu wa Kuanza Huduma ya Maji

463
00:27:45,783 --> 00:27:47,950
Samahani.

464
00:27:47,973 --> 00:27:50,940
Je, ni ofisi ya Maji ya Minami?

465
00:27:50,963 --> 00:27:53,805
Nimehamia nyumbani mpya.

466
00:27:53,829 --> 00:27:58,162
Ningependa kuanza huduma ya maji.

467
00:27:58,185 --> 00:28:00,785
Asante kwa kupiga simu.

468
00:28:00,808 --> 00:28:04,041
Hii ni ofisi ya Maji ya Minami.

469
00:28:04,064 --> 00:28:06,798
Unataka kuanza huduma ya maji, ndivyo?

470
00:28:06,821 --> 00:28:09,454
Ndiyo, hiyo ndiyo.

471
00:28:09,477 --> 00:28:15,810
Kiswahili changu bado si kizuri sana, kwa hivyo nina wasiwasi kidogo.

472
00:28:15,833 --> 00:28:18,513
Hakuna matata.

473
00:28:18,537 --> 00:28:21,509
Nitazungumza polepole.

474
00:28:21,532 --> 00:28:27,305
Kwanza, tafadhali nipe anwani yako mpya na jina lako.

475
00:28:27,329 --> 00:28:34,600
Anwani yangu ni Shinjuku-ku, Nishi-Shinjuku 3-1-2.

476
00:28:34,623 --> 00:28:40,664
Jina la apartment ni Midori-Sō, chumba cha 201.

477
00:28:40,688 --> 00:28:49,181
Wilaya ya Shinjuku, Nishi-Shinjuku 3-1-2, Nyumba ya Midori, chumba cha 201, ndivyo?

478
00:28:49,204 --> 00:28:52,475
Tafadhali nipe jina lako.

479
00:28:52,499 --> 00:28:54,551
Maria.

480
00:28:54,574 --> 00:28:56,707
Maria, ndivyo?

481
00:28:56,730 --> 00:28:58,947
Asante.

482
00:28:58,971 --> 00:29:01,846
Una nambari ya simu?

483
00:29:01,869 --> 00:29:04,521
Ndiyo, nina.

484
00:29:04,545 --> 00:29:11,678
090-1234-5678.

485
00:29:11,701 --> 00:29:13,669
Asante.

486
00:29:13,692 --> 00:29:16,667
Je, unataka kuanza kutumia maji leo?

487
00:29:16,691 --> 00:29:20,424
Ndiyo, nataka kuanza kutumia leo.

488
00:29:20,447 --> 00:29:23,489
Sasa niko ndani ya chumba.

489
00:29:23,513 --> 00:29:27,646
Lakini sijafungua kranini bado.

490
00:29:27,669 --> 00:29:29,669
Nimeelewa.

491
00:29:29,692 --> 00:29:34,259
Basi, tutaangalia pamoja sasa.

492
00:29:34,282 --> 00:29:36,848
Nenda jikoni tafadhali.

493
00:29:36,871 --> 00:29:40,738
Sasa niko jikoni.

494
00:29:40,762 --> 00:29:43,962
Fungua kranini polepole.

495
00:29:43,985 --> 00:29:46,519
Je, maji yanatoka?

496
00:29:46,542 --> 00:29:49,308
Ninafungua sasa.

497
00:29:49,331 --> 00:29:52,343
Nina wasiwasi kidogo.

498
00:29:52,367 --> 00:29:55,334
Aa, maji hayatoki.

499
00:29:55,357 --> 00:29:57,836
Nifanyeje?

500
00:29:57,859 --> 00:30:00,326
Maji hayatoki?

501
00:30:00,349 --> 00:30:04,359
Basi, tutaangalia kizibo cha nje.

502
00:30:04,382 --> 00:30:07,382
Kizibo?

503
00:30:07,405 --> 00:30:09,872
Ni nini hicho?

504
00:30:09,895 --> 00:30:13,862
Hii inahusu swichi ya maji iliyo nje.

505
00:30:13,885 --> 00:30:18,528
Kuna sanduku la buluu karibu na ingia kwenye sakafu?

506
00:30:18,551 --> 00:30:21,160
Sanduku la buluu?

507
00:30:21,184 --> 00:30:24,784
Nitapiga kona nje kidogo.

508
00:30:24,807 --> 00:30:28,174
Aa, kuna sanduku la buluu kwenye sakafu.

509
00:30:28,197 --> 00:30:31,063
Fungua sanduku hilo tafadhali.

510
00:30:31,086 --> 00:30:35,020
Ndani kuna handeli nyeusi ya mviringo.

511
00:30:35,043 --> 00:30:37,939
Nimefungua.

512
00:30:37,962 --> 00:30:40,653
Kuna handeli nyeusi.

513
00:30:40,677 --> 00:30:45,090
Zungusha handeli hiyo kulia kwa nguvu.

514
00:30:45,113 --> 00:30:47,195
Sawa, nimeelewa.

515
00:30:47,218 --> 00:30:49,115
Nazungusha.

516
00:30:49,139 --> 00:30:51,739
Inaonekana nzito kidogo, sivyo?

517
00:30:51,762 --> 00:30:55,580
Aa, nimeshazungusha sana.

518
00:30:55,603 --> 00:30:57,261
Asante.

519
00:30:57,285 --> 00:31:01,256
Sasa rudi jikoni tena.

520
00:31:01,279 --> 00:31:04,214
Sawa, nimerudi.

521
00:31:04,238 --> 00:31:07,571
Fungua kran tena tafadhali.

522
00:31:07,594 --> 00:31:10,478
Ninafungua sasa.

523
00:31:10,502 --> 00:31:15,335
Aa, maji yameanza kutiririka kwa nguvu!

524
00:31:15,358 --> 00:31:17,837
Ninashangaa sana!

525
00:31:17,861 --> 00:31:20,128
Sawa, nimeshapata faraja.

526
00:31:20,151 --> 00:31:23,027
Sasa maji yameanza kutoka bila matatizo.

527
00:31:23,050 --> 00:31:26,389
Ndiyo, nimefurahi.

528
00:31:26,413 --> 00:31:29,779
Sasa unaweza kunywa maji safi.

529
00:31:29,802 --> 00:31:32,336
Kuna hatua moja tu inayobaki.

530
00:31:32,359 --> 00:31:34,968
Tazama kwenye sanduku la barua.

531
00:31:34,991 --> 00:31:37,058
Sanduku la barua?

532
00:31:37,081 --> 00:31:39,566
Kuna nini ndani?

533
00:31:39,590 --> 00:31:43,956
Kuna kadi yenye maandishi 'Fomu ya Kuomba Maji'.

534
00:31:43,979 --> 00:31:46,179
Kadi?

535
00:31:46,202 --> 00:31:49,069
Aa, ipo chumbani.

536
00:31:49,092 --> 00:31:51,951
Nimeipata kutoka kwa wakala wa nyumba.

537
00:31:51,974 --> 00:31:54,741
Sawa, nimeshapata faraja.

538
00:31:54,764 --> 00:32:01,368
Andika tarehe ya leo, jina lako na anwani yako kwenye kadi hiyo.

539
00:32:01,392 --> 00:32:04,158
Jina na anwani, ndiyo?

540
00:32:04,181 --> 00:32:06,018
Sawa, nimeelewa.

541
00:32:06,041 --> 00:32:08,284
Andika tafadhali.

542
00:32:08,308 --> 00:32:11,908
Kisha weka kadi hiyo kwenye sanduku la barua.

543
00:32:11,931 --> 00:32:15,164
Je, nahitaji stempu?

544
00:32:15,187 --> 00:32:17,244
Haitaji stempu.

545
00:32:17,268 --> 00:32:19,201
Hii ni rahisi sana!

546
00:32:19,224 --> 00:32:21,891
Nitaandika mara moja leo.

547
00:32:21,915 --> 00:32:24,148
Tafadhali, ninaomba.

548
00:32:24,171 --> 00:32:27,771
Hii ndiyo mwisho wa mchakato wa maji kwa leo.

549
00:32:27,794 --> 00:32:30,278
Nimeelewa.

550
00:32:30,301 --> 00:32:34,784
Asante kwa kunieleza kwa utulivu.

551
00:32:34,807 --> 00:32:37,489
La, karibu.

552
00:32:37,513 --> 00:32:40,513
Ufurahie maisha mazuri.

553
00:32:40,536 --> 00:32:43,539
Sawa, kwa heri.

554
00:32:43,562 --> 00:32:46,562
Mstari wa 8: Ukaguzi wa Ufungaji Gesi

555
00:32:46,562 --> 00:32:48,740
Ding dong.

556
00:32:48,764 --> 00:32:50,057
Hujambo.

557
00:32:50,080 --> 00:32:52,698
Hii ni Gesi ya Kusini.

558
00:32:52,722 --> 00:32:56,393
Tumekuja kwa ukaguzi wa kufungua gesi.

559
00:32:56,416 --> 00:32:58,616
Karibu.

560
00:32:58,639 --> 00:33:01,658
Aa, ni mtu wa kampuni ya gesi.

561
00:33:01,681 --> 00:33:04,448
Nitafungua mlango.

562
00:33:04,471 --> 00:33:06,046
Nawaonea heshima.

563
00:33:06,069 --> 00:33:08,803
Mimi ni Yamada kutoka Gesi ya Kusini.

564
00:33:08,826 --> 00:33:13,118
Leo tutafanya mchakato wa kufungua gesi.

565
00:33:13,141 --> 00:33:15,775
Ndiyo, mimi ni Maria.

566
00:33:15,798 --> 00:33:17,798
Tafadhali, ninaomba.

567
00:33:17,821 --> 00:33:23,118
Mtu asiyenijua atakuja ndani ya chumba, kwa hiyo naona kidogo wasiwasi.

568
00:33:23,142 --> 00:33:25,708
Ndiyo, naelewa.

569
00:33:25,731 --> 00:33:28,387
Samahani kwa kukufanya uwe na wasiwasi.

570
00:33:28,411 --> 00:33:31,744
Nitangoa viatu naingia.

571
00:33:31,767 --> 00:33:34,136
Ndiyo, karibu.

572
00:33:34,160 --> 00:33:36,166
Tafadhali ingia hapa.

573
00:33:36,189 --> 00:33:37,862
Asante.

574
00:33:37,886 --> 00:33:42,155
Kwanza tutaangalia vifaa vya gesi kwenye chumba.

575
00:33:42,179 --> 00:33:45,982
Jiko la gesi liko wapi jikoni?

576
00:33:46,005 --> 00:33:48,839
Jiko ni hapa.

577
00:33:48,862 --> 00:33:51,595
Ninataka kutumia jiko hili.

578
00:33:51,618 --> 00:33:53,351
Asante.

579
00:33:53,374 --> 00:33:55,251
Hili ndilo.

580
00:33:55,275 --> 00:33:58,009
Tutafanya ukaguzi wa usalama.

581
00:33:58,032 --> 00:34:00,650
Subiri kidogo.

582
00:34:00,673 --> 00:34:03,492
Sawa, nimeelewa.

583
00:34:03,515 --> 00:34:06,049
Unaangalia nini?

584
00:34:06,072 --> 00:34:10,605
Naangalia kama bomba la gesi limeunganishwa vizuri.

585
00:34:10,628 --> 00:34:14,995
Hakuna gesi inayotoka, hivyo hakuna tatizo.

586
00:34:15,018 --> 00:34:18,351
Ndiyo? Sawa, nashukuru.

587
00:34:18,374 --> 00:34:23,107
Gesi ni kidogo ya kutisha, kwa hiyo nimefurahi.

588
00:34:23,130 --> 00:34:27,586
Ndiyo, usalama ni muhimu zaidi.

589
00:34:27,610 --> 00:34:31,543
Sasa tutafanya jaribio la kuwasha jiko la gesi.

590
00:34:31,566 --> 00:34:35,333
Je, mimi sitafanya chochote?

591
00:34:35,356 --> 00:34:38,050
Ndiyo, angalia tu.

592
00:34:38,074 --> 00:34:42,074
Nitapiga swichi sasa.

593
00:34:42,097 --> 00:34:44,700
Kach, kach.

594
00:34:44,723 --> 00:34:46,523
Poof.

595
00:34:46,546 --> 00:34:49,512
Moto wa buluu umewaka.

596
00:34:49,535 --> 00:34:51,735
Incredible!

597
00:34:51,758 --> 00:34:55,292
Ndiyo, moto umewaka vizuri.

598
00:34:55,315 --> 00:34:57,648
Jiko limepita kwenye ukaguzi.

599
00:34:57,671 --> 00:35:02,638
Sasa tutaangalia kiwashio cha maji moto kwenye bafu na sehemu ya kunawa uso.

600
00:35:02,661 --> 00:35:05,194
Bafu liko wapi?

601
00:35:05,217 --> 00:35:08,387
Bafu ni hapa.

602
00:35:08,411 --> 00:35:09,977
Tafadhali.

603
00:35:10,000 --> 00:35:11,605
Nawaonea heshima.

604
00:35:11,629 --> 00:35:15,042
Tutajaribu maji moto sasa.

605
00:35:15,065 --> 00:35:17,472
Nitazungusha kranii.

606
00:35:17,496 --> 00:35:19,705
Sawa, naomba.

607
00:35:19,729 --> 00:35:23,062
Tutiririsha maji kwa muda.

608
00:35:23,085 --> 00:35:25,618
Gesi inatumika.

609
00:35:25,641 --> 00:35:28,841
Aa, maji yamekuwa moto!

610
00:35:28,864 --> 00:35:30,670
Kweli?

611
00:35:30,694 --> 00:35:34,627
Ndiyo, gusa maji haya.

612
00:35:34,650 --> 00:35:37,217
Yako moto!

613
00:35:37,240 --> 00:35:39,896
Ndiyo, nitagusa.

614
00:35:39,919 --> 00:35:43,486
Waa, yako moto kweli!

615
00:35:43,509 --> 00:35:47,442
Maji moto yanatoka vizuri.

616
00:35:47,465 --> 00:35:52,499
Ndiyo, kwa hiyo unaweza kuoga kwa maji moto kila siku.

617
00:35:52,522 --> 00:35:54,355
Ninashangaa sana!

618
00:35:54,378 --> 00:35:59,345
Majira ya baridi nchini Japani ni baridi, kwa hiyo napenda maji moto.

619
00:35:59,368 --> 00:36:01,458
Nimejifurahisha sana.

620
00:36:01,482 --> 00:36:06,291
Hivyo, ukaguzi wa usalama wa gesi na jaribio la maji moto limekwisha.

621
00:36:06,314 --> 00:36:08,681
Asante.

622
00:36:08,704 --> 00:36:13,039
Sikufanya chochote mwenyewe, sivyo?

623
00:36:13,063 --> 00:36:17,832
Ndiyo, sisi tutaangalia kila kitu, hivyo usijali.

624
00:36:17,856 --> 00:36:22,270
Sasa, tafadhali sahihi hapa chini.

625
00:36:22,294 --> 00:36:26,149
Saini? Nitaandika wapi?

626
00:36:26,172 --> 00:36:30,905
Tafadhali andika jina lako kwenye skrini ya kibodi hii.

627
00:36:30,928 --> 00:36:33,461
Tumethibitisha.

628
00:36:33,484 --> 00:36:36,484
Sehemu ya 9: Maelezo kuhusu Kadi ya Ujumbe wa Kutokuwepo / Maelezo Kuhusu Kadi ya Ujumbe wa Kutokuwepo Wakati wa Kufikisha

629
00:36:36,484 --> 00:36:38,484
Samahani.

630
00:36:38,507 --> 00:36:40,085
Hujambo.

631
00:36:40,109 --> 00:36:42,794
Una tatizo gani?

632
00:36:42,818 --> 00:36:48,151
Nimepata karatasi nyekundu hii kwenye sanduku la barua nyumbani kwangu.

633
00:36:48,174 --> 00:36:52,107
Aa, hii ni kadi ya ujumbe wa kutokuwepo.

634
00:36:52,130 --> 00:36:56,468
Kadi ya ujumbe wa kutokuwepo?

635
00:36:56,492 --> 00:36:59,869
Nilishangaa sana.

636
00:36:59,893 --> 00:37:03,459
Nimefanya kosa lolote?

637
00:37:03,482 --> 00:37:07,094
Hapana, si kosa lolote.

638
00:37:07,118 --> 00:37:12,851
Watu wa posta walikuja na mzigo wakati hujawakuwepo nyumbani.

639
00:37:12,874 --> 00:37:17,041
Kwa hiyo, waliweka karatasi hii kwenye sanduku la barua.

640
00:37:17,064 --> 00:37:18,597
Nimeelewa.

641
00:37:18,620 --> 00:37:21,705
Si kosa lolote, basi.

642
00:37:21,728 --> 00:37:23,939
Nimejifunza na kupata amani.

643
00:37:23,962 --> 00:37:26,735
Ndiyo, hakuna matatizo.

644
00:37:26,759 --> 00:37:29,692
Nipe karatasi nyekundu hiyo.

645
00:37:29,715 --> 00:37:32,115
Ndiyo, karibu.

646
00:37:32,138 --> 00:37:33,876
Asante.

647
00:37:33,900 --> 00:37:36,598
Nitathibitisha mzigo.

648
00:37:36,621 --> 00:37:41,028
Aa, hii ni barua muhimu sana.

649
00:37:41,051 --> 00:37:43,950
Barua muhimu?

650
00:37:43,974 --> 00:37:45,910
Ni nini?

651
00:37:45,933 --> 00:37:49,367
Hii ni hati kutoka Ofisi ya Udhibiti wa Wageni.

652
00:37:49,391 --> 00:37:52,724
Tutathibitisha utambulisho wako.

653
00:37:52,747 --> 00:37:55,645
Una pasipoti?

654
00:37:55,669 --> 00:37:58,319
Ndiyo, iko ndani ya begi yangu.

655
00:37:58,342 --> 00:38:01,921
Nitatoa pasipoti yangu.

656
00:38:01,945 --> 00:38:03,478
Hii ndiyo.

657
00:38:03,501 --> 00:38:04,935
Tafadhali.

658
00:38:04,958 --> 00:38:06,558
Asante.

659
00:38:06,581 --> 00:38:09,414
Nitathibitisha jina lako.

660
00:38:09,437 --> 00:38:12,704
Jina lako ni Maria?

661
00:38:12,728 --> 00:38:15,661
Ndiyo, mimi ni Maria.

662
00:38:15,684 --> 00:38:17,917
Anwani yako ni Shinjuku-ku?

663
00:38:17,940 --> 00:38:20,993
Ndiyo, Shinjuku-ku.

664
00:38:21,017 --> 00:38:23,217
Ndiyo, nimeithibitisha.

665
00:38:23,240 --> 00:38:25,484
Nakuruhusu pasipoti yako.

666
00:38:25,508 --> 00:38:27,365
Asante.

667
00:38:27,388 --> 00:38:31,154
Sasa, tafadhali weka saini hapa.

668
00:38:31,177 --> 00:38:32,777
Saini?

669
00:38:32,800 --> 00:38:35,285
Nitaandika wapi?

670
00:38:35,309 --> 00:38:39,000
Tafadhali andika hapa kwenye karatasi nyeupe hii.

671
00:38:39,023 --> 00:38:41,357
Jina kwa Kiingereza?

672
00:38:41,380 --> 00:38:43,316
Katakana?

673
00:38:43,339 --> 00:38:46,905
Andika jina kama lilivyo kwenye pasipoti yako.

674
00:38:46,928 --> 00:38:48,728
Sawa, nimeelewa.

675
00:38:48,751 --> 00:38:51,118
Nitaandika hapa.

676
00:38:51,141 --> 00:38:52,953
Nimekamilisha.

677
00:38:52,976 --> 00:38:55,023
Asante sana.

678
00:38:55,047 --> 00:38:57,919
Sasa nitakuleta mzigo.

679
00:38:57,943 --> 00:39:00,143
Subiri kidogo.

680
00:39:00,166 --> 00:39:02,623
Sawa, nimeelewa.

681
00:39:02,646 --> 00:39:04,822
Umesubiriwa.

682
00:39:04,846 --> 00:39:07,379
Hii ni bahasha ya buluu.

683
00:39:07,403 --> 00:39:08,769
Tafadhali.

684
00:39:08,792 --> 00:39:10,459
Asante.

685
00:39:10,482 --> 00:39:13,615
Aa, ndani kuna kadi.

686
00:39:13,638 --> 00:39:17,111
Hii ni kadi yangu ya kukaa?

687
00:39:17,135 --> 00:39:19,703
Ndiyo, ndiyo hiyo.

688
00:39:19,726 --> 00:39:23,360
Hii ni kadi muhimu sana, basi angalia kwa makini.

689
00:39:23,383 --> 00:39:26,116
Sawa, nimeelewa.

690
00:39:26,139 --> 00:39:29,107
Kutoka leo nitaiweka nami daima.

691
00:39:29,130 --> 00:39:32,897
Kutoka leo maisha yako nchini Japani yataanza.

692
00:39:32,920 --> 00:39:34,564
Jitahidi.

693
00:39:34,587 --> 00:39:37,206
Asante sana.

694
00:39:37,230 --> 00:39:41,364
Watu wa posta walikuwa watu wema sana.

695
00:39:41,387 --> 00:39:43,630
Nilifurahi sana.

696
00:39:43,653 --> 00:39:46,140
La, karibu.

697
00:39:46,164 --> 00:39:47,730
Kwa heri.

698
00:39:47,753 --> 00:39:49,401
Kwa heri.

699
00:39:49,425 --> 00:39:52,425
Mlo 10: Ukaguzi wa Kwanza Hospitalini Japani

700
00:39:52,425 --> 00:39:54,360
Samahani.

701
00:39:54,383 --> 00:39:55,802
Hujambo.

702
00:39:55,826 --> 00:39:58,959
Umekuwaje leo?

703
00:39:58,982 --> 00:40:01,982
Tangu jana nina homa.

704
00:40:02,005 --> 00:40:05,180
Mwili wangu unaumwa sana.

705
00:40:05,204 --> 00:40:07,898
Hiyo ni mbaya sana.

706
00:40:07,922 --> 00:40:10,964
Je, ni mara yako ya kwanza kuja hospitali hii?

707
00:40:10,988 --> 00:40:13,998
Ndiyo, ni mara yangu ya kwanza.

708
00:40:14,021 --> 00:40:19,454
Ni mara yangu ya kwanza kuja hospitalini Japani, na nina wasiwasi sana.

709
00:40:19,477 --> 00:40:21,736
Hakuna matata.

710
00:40:21,760 --> 00:40:24,006
Usijali.

711
00:40:24,029 --> 00:40:28,510
Je, una karata ya bima ya afya?

712
00:40:28,534 --> 00:40:31,471
Ndiyo, nina.

713
00:40:31,495 --> 00:40:34,695
Niliipata wiki iliyopita katika ofisi ya manispaa.

714
00:40:34,718 --> 00:40:36,553
Hii ndiyo.

715
00:40:36,576 --> 00:40:38,228
Tafadhali.

716
00:40:38,252 --> 00:40:40,052
Asante.

717
00:40:40,075 --> 00:40:42,120
Nitaihifadhi kwa muda.

718
00:40:42,144 --> 00:40:44,956
Sawa, nimeithibitisha.

719
00:40:44,979 --> 00:40:49,412
Sasa, tafadhali pima joto lako.

720
00:40:49,435 --> 00:40:52,522
Nipime joto?

721
00:40:52,546 --> 00:40:55,585
Nipimeje?

722
00:40:55,609 --> 00:40:59,622
Tafadhali tumia thermometa hii.

723
00:40:59,645 --> 00:41:02,120
Wekea chini ya kwapa.

724
00:41:02,143 --> 00:41:04,743
Sawa, nimeelewa.

725
00:41:04,766 --> 00:41:07,047
Chini ya kwapa, ndiyo.

726
00:41:07,071 --> 00:41:11,204
Subiri kidogo mpaka iwekee sauti.

727
00:41:11,227 --> 00:41:13,160
Sawa.

728
00:41:13,183 --> 00:41:16,317
Aa, imetoa sauti.

729
00:41:16,340 --> 00:41:18,573
Nionyeshe.

730
00:41:18,596 --> 00:41:21,563
Homa ni digrii 38.5.

731
00:41:21,586 --> 00:41:24,406
Una homa kali sana.

732
00:41:24,429 --> 00:41:28,524
Ndiyo, ninakataa baridi sana.

733
00:41:28,548 --> 00:41:34,194
Sasa, tafadhali jaza karatasi hii inayoitwa fomu ya uchunguzi.

734
00:41:34,217 --> 00:41:37,784
Fomu ya uchunguzi?

735
00:41:37,807 --> 00:41:40,977
Kuna herufi nyingi za Kichina.

736
00:41:41,000 --> 00:41:43,973
Siwezi kuandika.

737
00:41:43,996 --> 00:41:45,996
Sawa, nimeelewa.

738
00:41:46,019 --> 00:41:49,719
Basi, nitakuuliza mimi.

739
00:41:49,742 --> 00:41:52,909
Wewe jibu tu.

740
00:41:52,932 --> 00:41:55,265
Asante sana.

741
00:41:55,288 --> 00:41:57,387
Nitasaidiwa sana.

742
00:41:57,411 --> 00:42:01,270
Sasa, sehemu gani inakupata zaidi?

743
00:42:01,294 --> 00:42:05,097
Kichwa na koo vinaniuma sana.

744
00:42:05,120 --> 00:42:08,787
Kichwa na koo, ndiyo.

745
00:42:08,810 --> 00:42:11,902
Una kikohozi au mafua?

746
00:42:11,925 --> 00:42:16,597
Nina kikohozi kidogo, lakini sina mafua.

747
00:42:16,620 --> 00:42:18,454
Sawa, nimeelewa.

748
00:42:18,477 --> 00:42:21,330
Umeanza homa lini?

749
00:42:21,353 --> 00:42:24,787
Tangu jana usiku nina homa.

750
00:42:24,810 --> 00:42:27,425
Tangu jana usiku, ndiyo.

751
00:42:27,449 --> 00:42:30,015
Umekula chakula?

752
00:42:30,038 --> 00:42:34,438
Hapana, tangu jana sijala chochote.

753
00:42:34,461 --> 00:42:37,339
Tumbo linaniuma.

754
00:42:37,363 --> 00:42:41,022
Hiyo ni huruma.

755
00:42:41,046 --> 00:42:43,812
Una mzio wa dawa yoyote?

756
00:42:43,835 --> 00:42:46,293
Hapana, sina.

757
00:42:46,316 --> 00:42:50,807
Je, unatumia dawa kutoka hospitali nyingine sasa?

758
00:42:50,831 --> 00:42:54,564
Hapana, sili chochote.

759
00:42:54,587 --> 00:42:56,521
Nimeelewa.

760
00:42:56,545 --> 00:43:00,483
Hivyo ndivyo mwisho wa kujaza karatasi.

761
00:43:00,506 --> 00:43:02,483
Asante.

762
00:43:02,507 --> 00:43:05,311
Nimefurahi kwamba wewe ni mtu mpole.

763
00:43:05,334 --> 00:43:08,368
La, karibu.

764
00:43:08,391 --> 00:43:12,288
Tafadhali, kaa kwenye sofa ile.

765
00:43:12,311 --> 00:43:17,344
Subiri mpaka mwalimu akwambie jina lako.

766
00:43:17,367 --> 00:43:19,946
Sawa, nimeelewa.

767
00:43:19,970 --> 00:43:22,304
Nitakaa na kusubiri.